  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>What if your shoes could train your brain? Introducing the Nike Mind 001, a revolutionary blend of neuroscience and comfort designed to elevate your pregame ritual. Developed by Nike’s Mind Science Department, these pregame mules feature 22 dynamic outsole nodes that gently press against your foot with every step and activate sensory areas of the brain. The knit tongue with breathable perforations keeps your feet cool and relaxed, so your mental warm-up feels as good as your physical one. Train your mind like you train your body and let every step sharpen your edge with the Nike Mind 001.</p> <p><strong>Nike Mind 001 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Soft foam in the midsole provides robust, comfortable cushioning.</li> <li>Stretchy fabric on the footbed gives the nodes room to move up and down.</li> <li>Rubber pods near the toe and heel help provide durable traction.</li> </ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Mind 001 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Pink Smoke/Mtlc Silver/Mystic Dates</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufa